't enter..                         * *\n* *     Are you below level 8 Don't enter alone..                   * *\n* *                                                                 * *\n* ******************************************************************* *\n*                                                                     *\n***********************************************************************"}],"pos":[2,0,3]},{"vnum":4010,"name":"The cave","desc":"   You are in a cave, to the south you sense fresh air. To the north a\nsmall tunnel continues into the mountain.","flags":["dark","indoors"],"sector":"field","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":4011,"openCmd":4011},{"dir":2,"to":4002}],"extras":[],"pos":[2,0,2]},{"vnum":4011,"name":"The tunnel","desc":"   You force your way through a small tunnel, to you south you sense \na little fresh air, and to the north the tunnel continues.","flags":["dark","indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":4014},{"dir":2,"to":4010}],"extras":[],"pos":[2,0,1]},{"vnum":4012,"name":"The tunnel","desc":"   You are in a small tunnel, to the north there is a cave. The tunnel\ncontinues to the east.","flags":["dark","indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":4016},{"dir":1,"to":4013}],"extras":[],"pos":[0,0,0]},{"vnum":4013,"name":"The tunnel","desc":"   You are in a small tunnel leading east-west. The floor is covered by\ndust.","flags":["dark","indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":4014},{"dir":3,"to":4012}],"extras":[],"pos":[1,0,0]},{"vnum":4014,"name":"The tunnel","desc":"   You are in a tunnel, the tunnel continues to the south and to the \nwest, to the north there is a cave.","flags":["dark","indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":4018},{"dir":2,"to":4011},{"dir":3,"to":4013}],"extras":[],"pos":[2,0,0]},{"vnum":4015,"name":"The tunnel","desc":"   You are in a small tunnel, the tunnel continues west.","flags":["dark","indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":4019},{"dir":3,"to":4014}],"extras